      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure if a ConcurrentHashMap will help in this case because while it can protect from concurrency issues when inserting and retrieving values (the set of indices mapping to an iface name), the set object itself doesn\u0027t benefit from any concurrency guarantees, and can be modified by addInterface after it has been retrieved.\n\nI\u0027ve added a ReadWriteLock as suggested below, let me know if that addresses this concern!",
